## Run

```sh
uv sync
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```
{%- if c.workers or c.jobs or c.consumers %}

Workers and scheduled jobs run separately:

```sh
uv run python -m app.workers
```
{%- endif %}

Or bring up the full stack (API{% if c.workers or c.jobs or c.consumers %}, workers/jobs{% endif %}{% if c.has_db %}, Postgres{% endif %}{% if c.has_cache %}, Redis{% endif %}{% if c.has_queue %}, NATS{% endif %}):

```sh
docker compose up --build
```

## Test & lint

```sh
uv run pytest
uv run ruff check .
```

## Layout

| Path | Purpose | Owner |
|------|---------|-------|
| `app/main.py` | Application assembly | compiler |
| `app/api/` | HTTP routers (one per api) | compiler |
| `app/services/` | Business-logic handlers | **you** |
| `app/workers/` | Queue consumers and scheduled jobs | compiler |
| `app/config.py` | Environment-driven settings | compiler |
{%- if c.has_auth %}

Requests to protected routes need a bearer token signed with
`JWT_SECRET` (default `change-me`, algorithm HS256).
{%- endif %}
